# APDU sequence sent by release/2.x commit c488da3: readAll(with_photo: true), ATR not starting 3B 67, GET RESPONSE P2 = 00.
# It states what the old code sends, not what a card requires. Nothing here was captured on a card.
# Order in ThaiIDCard.readAll: SELECT, CID, person info, address, issue/expire, issuer, photo chunks.
# SendCommand sends GET RESPONSE with SW2, so this assumes the card answers 61 <requested Le> to each READ.
# SELECT is not followed by GET RESPONSE in 2.x. Photo is one transmit per chunk (the fix in 2.x).
# c488da3 already sends issue/expire with Le 10, so that is NOT a difference between 2.x and v3.
